<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Medical Certificate</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <style>
    :root {
      --font-stack: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      --border-color: #000;
    }

    /* Page setup for A4 portrait */
    @page {
      size: A4 portrait;
      margin: 1.5cm;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #fff;
      font-family: var(--font-stack);
      color: #000;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 2;
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    }

    .certificate {
      /* fill the full printable height */
      min-height: calc(297mm - 3cm); /* A4 height minus top+bottom margins */
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .header {
      /* nothing special */
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      margin: 0.2rem 0 0.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .subhead {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0.1rem 0;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }

    .italic {
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      flex: 1; /* allow middle to stretch */
    }

    .line {
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 180px;
      border-bottom: none;
      position: relative;
      padding-right: 4px;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .line.short {
      min-width: 90px;
    }

    .underscore-line {
      display: block;
      font-family: monospace;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      /* letter-spacing: 1px; */
      margin: 6px 0;
    }

    .fill {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .checkbox-group {
      margin: 0.75rem 0;
    }

    .checkbox-line {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .checkbox-box {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .doctor {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .title-small {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      margin: 2px 0;
    }

    .license {
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Print adjustments */
    @media print {
      body {
        padding: 0;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .certificate {
        padding: 1.2rem 1.8rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="certificate" aria-label="Medical Certificate">
    <div class="header">
      <div style="text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-weight:700; font-size:1rem;">
          YBIERNAS EAR NOSE THROAT HEAD AND NECK SURGERY CLINIC
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">Consultation Room 1</div>
        <div class="subhead">Doctors Community Hospital</div>
        <div class="subhead">Mawab, Davao de Oro, Philippines</div>
        <div class="contact">
          Contact: 0932 322 0523; 0917 704 4317<br>
          <span class="italic">bongybiernas@yahoo.com</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1>MEDICAL CERTIFICATE</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div style="margin-top:6px;">
        <strong>Date:</strong>__________
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:8px;">
        This is to certify that ____________________________ ____years old,
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:6px;">_______,
        from _________
        was seen at the clinic on ____________
        and was diagnosed to have ______________________________.
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:6px;">
        He/She was treated for such with:
      </div> ______________________

      <div style="margin-top:8px;">
        Medications include the following:
      </div>
      <div>__________________________________________________</div>
      <div>__________________________________________________</div>
      <div>__________________________________________________</div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="checkbox-group" style="line-height: 1.15">
        <div class="checkbox-line">
          <div class="checkbox-box" aria-label="checkbox"></div>
          <div>
            <strong>Advised to rest for</strong>
            <span class="underscore-line" style="display:inline-block; width: 80px; margin:0;">_____________</span> days.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="checkbox-line">
          <div class="checkbox-box" aria-label="checkbox"></div>
          <div>
            <strong>Must make a follow-up visit on</strong>
            <span class="underscore-line" style="display:inline-block; width: 180px; margin:0;">________________________________</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="checkbox-line">
          <div class="checkbox-box" aria-label="checkbox"></div>
          <div>
            <strong>Others</strong>
            <span class="underscore-line" style="display:inline-block; width: 220px; margin:0;">______________________________________</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:8px;">
      Issued for whatever legal purpose this may serve him or her best.
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div class="doctor">ANTONIO P. YBIERNAS JR., M.D., COHC</div>
      <div class="title-small">Otolaryngology-Head and Neck Surgery Specialist</div>
      <div class="title-small">U.S. Certified Occupational Hearing Conservationist</div>
      <div class="license">Lic Number: 0085800</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
